meeting: m1 | 2026-09-14T09:30:00Z | ingested=2026-09-14T12:30:00Z
aisha: Good morning everyone, thanks for making time. Today we need to settle the basics of the procurement pilot: the vendor, the budget, and when we go live.
raj: Morning. Finance has only seen draft numbers so far, so I would like to keep the budget talk practical.
wei_ling: And from IT, I have done demos with all three vendors over the past two weeks, so I can speak to the technical fit.
aisha: Great. Wei Ling, give us the short version.
wei_ling: Gamma Soft is the cheapest, but their reporting cannot do approvals by department, so I would drop them.  ## distractor tentative
raj: Agreed, Gamma Soft is out for me too.  ## distractor tentative
wei_ling: Alpha Systems and Beta Cloud both work. Alpha Systems has the better demo and can start immediately. Beta Cloud is more flexible but slower to onboard.
raj: On price, Alpha Systems is cheaper. Beta Cloud's licence is about 30,000 ringgit more for the pilot.
aisha: Then let's be decisive. We go with Alpha Systems for the pilot. Any objection?  ## event vendor.outcome = Alpha Systems | INITIAL | quote="We go with Alpha Systems for the pilot"
raj: No objection from finance.
wei_ling: Fine by me. I will tell Alpha Systems we are proceeding.
aisha: Good. Next, the budget. Raj, what number do you need?
raj: My draft says 300,000 ringgit, but honestly that includes a lot of contingency.  ## distractor tentative
aisha: 300,000 is too high for a pilot. The board will not approve that without a business case.
raj: Then I can make 250,000 ringgit work if we are careful with the training costs.  ## distractor tentative
aisha: Okay, the pilot budget is 250,000 ringgit. Raj, please note that down.  ## event budget.amount = 250000 | INITIAL | quote="the pilot budget is 250,000 ringgit"
raj: Noted.
aisha: Now timing. I would like to be live before the end of October. How about 26 October?
wei_ling: That is tight but doable if migration starts this week.
aisha: Then let's fix it. We go live on 26 October 2026.  ## event golive.date = 2026-10-26 | INITIAL | quote="We go live on 26 October 2026"
raj: Do we need a security review before go-live? I am not sure who would do that.  ## distractor question
aisha: Good question. Let's not decide the owner today. I will bring it back at the next meeting once we are sure about the vendor.  ## distractor tentative
wei_ling: Okay. For migration, I can take that. I will own the data migration and have it finished by 9 October.  ## event migration.owner = wei_ling | INITIAL | quote="I will own the data migration" ;; event migration.deadline = 2026-10-09 | INITIAL | quote="have it finished by 9 October"
aisha: Thank you Wei Ling.
aisha: And training. Staff need a week of training before go-live. I will coordinate it with HR myself and make sure training is finished by 16 October.  ## event training.owner = aisha | INITIAL | quote="I will coordinate it with HR myself" ;; event training.deadline = 2026-10-16 | INITIAL | quote="training is finished by 16 October"
raj: Do you want me to book the training room?  ## distractor question
aisha: Yes please, but that is only a favour. I remain the owner.  ## distractor untracked
wei_ling: One more thing. Maybe we should think about a mobile app later, but that is for another day.  ## distractor hypothetical
aisha: Parked. Let's meet again on 28 September. Thanks everyone.

meeting: m2 | 2026-09-28T09:30:00Z | ingested=2026-09-28T12:30:00Z
aisha: Morning. Two weeks in. Let's go through progress, and there is a security question we have to settle.
wei_ling: Before anything else, I have bad news on Alpha Systems. They failed our security questionnaire. They could not show that data stays in Malaysia, and they do not have the audit certificate we need.
raj: That is a problem. Are we sure? Their sales team told us it was all covered.  ## distractor question
wei_ling: I asked twice in writing. Their answer was that it is on the roadmap for next year.  ## distractor ignorable
aisha: Then we cannot use them for a pilot with procurement data. What about Beta Cloud?
wei_ling: Beta Cloud hosts in Cyberjaya and has the certificate. They can start next week.
aisha: Okay. We drop Alpha Systems and move to Beta Cloud. This is final.  ## event vendor.outcome = Beta Cloud | REVERSE | quote="We drop Alpha Systems and move to Beta Cloud"
raj: Fine, but then finance has to say the budget does not survive this change.
aisha: How much more is it?
raj: Beta Cloud's licence is 30,000 ringgit higher, so the pilot budget has to go from 250,000 to 280,000 ringgit.  ## distractor tentative
aisha: Can we absorb part of it from training costs?  ## distractor question
raj: No, training is already tight. I would rather ask for a clean increase.  ## distractor tentative
aisha: Fine. The pilot budget is now 280,000 ringgit. I will take it to the board.  ## event budget.amount = 280000 | REVISE | quote="The pilot budget is now 280,000 ringgit"
raj: Thanks. I will update the finance sheet today.
aisha: Go-live stays on 26 October for now.  ## event golive.date = 2026-10-26 | CONFIRM | quote="Go-live stays on 26 October"
wei_ling: Migration is going okay. I am still on track for 9 October.  ## event migration.deadline = 2026-10-09 | CONFIRM | quote="still on track for 9 October"
aisha: Good. Now security. Beta Cloud still needs our own review before we sign. Who can do it?
wei_ling: I can do it. I will own the security review and have it done by 5 October.  ## event security.owner = wei_ling | INITIAL | quote="I will own the security review" ;; event security.deadline = 2026-10-05 | INITIAL | quote="have it done by 5 October"
raj: Is that realistic with migration running at the same time?  ## distractor question
wei_ling: It will be busy, but yes.
raj: Maybe we should hire an outside consultant for the review?  ## distractor hypothetical
aisha: Let's not spend money on that. Wei Ling will do it.  ## distractor untracked
wei_ling: Also, maybe we could add a second pilot team in Penang.  ## distractor hypothetical
aisha: Interesting, but that is out of scope for now.
aisha: Anything else? No? Then the next meeting is on 12 October. Thanks.

meeting: m3 | 2026-10-12T09:30:00Z | ingested=2026-10-12T12:30:00Z
aisha: Morning. This is the last review before launch, so let's be straightforward about where we are.
wei_ling: I have to start with a miss. The data migration did not finish on the 9th. The old supplier records had duplicates and the clean-up took longer than planned.
aisha: How much longer do you need?
wei_ling: Two weeks. I can finish by 23 October.  ## distractor tentative
aisha: Okay. Data migration is now due on 23 October, same owner.  ## event migration.deadline = 2026-10-23 | REVISE | quote="Data migration is now due on 23 October"
raj: If migration finishes on the 23rd, then 26 October is unrealistic. Nobody can train on data that is not there.
aisha: Agreed. We have to move go-live. Let's say 9 November.  ## distractor tentative
wei_ling: 9 November works for me. That gives us over two weeks of testing after migration.
aisha: Then the go-live date is now 9 November 2026.  ## event golive.date = 2026-11-09 | REVISE | quote="the go-live date is now 9 November 2026"
raj: That also affects training. It was due on 16 October, but nobody can train on a system that is not ready.
aisha: Right. I will move training to 3 November so staff are trained a week before go-live. I stay the owner.  ## event training.deadline = 2026-11-03 | REVISE | quote="I will move training to 3 November"
wei_ling: Good news on security. The review of Beta Cloud is finished and they passed.
aisha: Excellent. Security review is done.  ## event security.status = done | COMPLETE | quote="Security review is done"
raj: On the budget, I checked again. The pilot is still 280,000 ringgit.  ## event budget.amount = 280000 | CONFIRM | quote="The pilot is still 280,000 ringgit"
aisha: Good, so no change to the budget.
raj: One more thing. Aisha will be travelling in the first week of November. Maybe I should cover the training for her.  ## distractor tentative
aisha: That is kind, Raj, but let's see how my calendar looks. I will keep it for now.  ## distractor untracked
wei_ling: Should we plan a lessons-learned session after go-live?  ## distractor question
aisha: Yes, but we will plan it later. Thank you everyone, see you after the launch.

